flowchart TB
  browser[Staff + student browsers] --> waf[AWS WAF]
  zoom[Zoom Webinars] -->|signed HTTPS webhooks| waf
  waf --> alb[Application Load Balancer, HTTPS]
  subgraph VPC[Proposed AWS VPC - Terraform, NOT APPLIED]
    alb -->|everything else| web[ECS Fargate: Next.js web]
    alb -->|/api/v1/zoom/webhooks| api[ECS Fargate: Spring API + workers]
    web -->|private service discovery| api
    api --> rds[(RDS PostgreSQL, private)]
    api --> s3[Private S3 exports]
    api --> sm[Secrets Manager]
    web --> sm
    rds --> backup[AWS Backup daily vault]
  end
  api -->|NAT| zoomapi[Zoom API]
  api -->|NAT| smtp[Mail provider]
  api --> cw[CloudWatch logs + alarms -> SNS email]
